  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "Inside a giant space-path Gu formation with yellow sky and purple sand ground, Fang Yuan names blood tide flowers among dozens of immortal materials at a glance, together with scribe grass, nutrient peaches, and immortal beans. Most of those materials are rank six, with a few at rank seven, and their quantity is shocking.",
