        "char_fang_yuan"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Other immortal materials in that field wither into fine purple sand the moment they leave the ground, leaving the display unusable. Fang Yuan reads the peaceful, insect-free planting as a sign that the stocks are wrong before he abandons gathering them.",
